From: Erhan Bilgili <erhan.bilgili@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] [build] Use Wineland libdisplay-info

Accept the 0.4.x EDID parser shared with regular DXVK. The Proton source
staging rule supplies the same pinned Wineland fork, including HDMI Forum
extension-count handling and Windows static-library support.

diff --git a/meson.build b/meson.build
--- a/meson.build
+++ b/meson.build
@@ -50,7 +50,7 @@ endif
 
 dep_displayinfo = dependency(
   'libdisplay-info',
-  version: ['>= 0.0.0', '< 0.2.0'],
+  version: ['>= 0.4.0', '< 0.5.0'],
   fallback: ['libdisplay-info', 'di_dep'],
   default_options: ['default_library=static'],
 )
